NOTE ON DATA: This licence covers the SOFTWARE (code) only. The atlas integrates
third-party data (TRRUST, PlantRegMap, PLAZA, OMA, JASPAR, Plant Reactome, GWAS
Catalog, UniProt, mygene.info, and others), each under its OWN upstream licence
and terms — several are academic-use-only. The repository does not redistribute
that data; it is fetched from the original sources at build time (see the fetch
scripts and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md). Consult each source's licence, cited in the
provenance manifest (GET /api/v1/provenance), before use or redistribution.
